  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Chant** (1 review): Reviewer recommends downloading mainly to hear Deaner rap [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Goin Gets Tough From The Getgo**: back after 131 archived shows (1555 days); rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Hey Bulldog**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Cocaine (Eric Clapton cover)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Drop The Bomb**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2006-07-26** (recommended): source not stated; 34 songs; 191 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says the recording's sound quality is poor; Preamp was switched off after Doctor Rock to save battery, so some crowd noise is missing [1][2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Ween2006-07-26**: Recorded with AKG 480 mics through a Lunatec V2 into a Sound Devices 744 at 24-bit/48kHz, then downsampled to 16-bit/44.1kHz in Audacity, edited and faded, and converted to FLAC [1]",
